<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MY LITTLE ADVENTURES</view><view class="title section">收藏快乐，分享发现。</view>
<view wx:if="{{!user}}" class="card section login-card"><image class="logo" src="/assets/logo.png"/><view class="section-title">你好，滑梯探索者</view><view class="muted">登录后，把发现的好去处装进口袋。</view><button class="primary section" bindtap="login" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">微信登录</button></view>
<block wx:else><view class="profile row section"><view class="avatar">{{user.nickname[0]}}</view><view class="grow"><view class="section-title">{{user.nickname}}</view><view class="muted">每一份分享，都让出门更有趣。</view></view></view><view class="stats section"><view><text class="number">{{user.shares}}</text><view>我的分享</view></view><view><text class="number">{{user.reviews}}</text><view>我的评价</view></view><view><text class="number">{{user.favorites}}</text><view>我的收藏</view></view></view>
<view class="card section"><text class="label">公开昵称</text><view class="row"><input class="input grow" type="nickname" maxlength="24" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="input" bindblur="input" placeholder="你希望大家怎么称呼你"/><button class="small primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存</button></view><view class="muted profile-note">昵称会显示在分享和评价旁；不收集手机号。</view></view>
<view class="chips section"><button class="chip {{scope==='favorites'?'active':''}}" data-value="favorites" bindtap="tab">我的收藏</button><button class="chip {{scope==='shares'?'active':''}}" data-value="shares" bindtap="tab">我的分享</button><button class="chip {{scope==='reviews'?'active':''}}" data-value="reviews" bindtap="tab">我的评价</button></view><view class="section"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><view class="grow"><view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted line-clamp">{{item.address}}</view></view><text class="rating">★ {{item.ratingLabel}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length && !loading && !error}}" class="empty">还没有足迹，去发现你的第一座滑梯吧。</view><button wx:if="{{nextOffset!==null}}" class="ghost" bindtap="more">加载更多</button></view><button class="ghost section" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button></block>
<view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在加载…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}<text class="link" bindtap="retry">　点击重试</text></view><view class="footer"><text class="link" bindtap="privacy">隐私说明与联系</text><view>滑滑梯地图 · 一起发现下一处快乐</view></view></view><privacy-dialog id="privacy"/>
